{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1535895-changeling-party","id":1535895,"title":"Changeling Party","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-05-19T05:22:21-07:00","id":1535895,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon1.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Changeling Party","content":"Just a question for your opinion, assuming a series based on Changeling the Dreaming was made, how do you think the cast of protagonists should be composed? I'm not talking about actors, but what kind of Changeling would be best to tell a story.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-01T03:10:59-07:00","id":1539629,"title":"","content":"It depends on the mood and themes of the series, and also the quantity of main characters. I\u2019d do a college comedy drama with some action and horror in the mix. The party would be a brooding, antisocial Sluagh, a social fighter Autumn Sidhe, a rich and spoiled but not evil Arcadian Sidhe, a lovely Boggan filled with repressed anger, an ever-wasted philosophy major Satyr, the most himbo Troll ever and finally a pooka majoring in drama/teaching. There would be more secondary characters but that\u2019s the main cast.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28543-josenitrox","name":"josenitrox","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-01T06:02:15-07:00","id":1539632,"title":"","content":"A college or art school would be a very strong pick for the setting. Compared to the weirdness du jour going on at any campus trolls and nockers will seem normal and relatable. I could see the action taking place in a city with several major schools like Boston, New York or the Bay Area. That way you could have a smaller college that serves the needs of Mages, Changelings, and allies. In cities like I've suggested &quot;weird college student&quot; is treated as redundant, all college students are weird and no one can be complained to because you can trace the person to complain to. This provides both plausible cover and rich storytelling territory all around.<br /> <br /> I think the main cast should be a small team of Changelings that are together for a project within the school. Options include but aren't limited to, a band, an acting troop, a mini circus that works the Ren Faire circuit, party/event organizers, ect. Jobs where eccentricity is counted fairly normal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}